	(text "RSH1 is 1 mΩ: 30 A produces 30 mV and 0.9 W. Configure INA237 ADCRANGE=1 (±40.96 mV). Route separate Kelvin sense traces from the resistor terminals to R11/R12; do not sample from the high-current pours."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 22.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "19db3e1e-51af-49a7-9e37-5afb6d86acf5")
	)
	(text "Both regulators are LM5164DDAR at approximately 300 kHz with 100 µH C2962892 inductors. The +12 V rail follows TI's 12 V/1 A Type-3 network except for the qualified 100 µH inductor; +3V3 reuses the carrier's Type-3 values."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a8a785ac-af74-482d-a425-ca7c0b6a9381")
	)
	(text "Input ceramics are 100 V rated. Add/qualify bulk input capacitance at PCB layout if the source is more than approximately 5 cm away. Verify VIN ringing, output ripple, PGOOD, inductor temperature, fan startup/stall, and current-sensor calibration on first articles."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ae7d7c97-d420-4f6e-a44e-16cd437588c8")
	)
	(text "POWER ENTRY, AGGREGATE CURRENT MONITOR, +3V3 AND +12V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 17.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b36a255f-4f28-40bb-bfbd-9880f2600a4f")
	)
